   "level": 4,
   "text": "Amylases"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- **Amylases** are produced in the **mouth** and the **pancreas** (secreted into the **duodenum**)\n- Amylases digest **starch into smaller sugars**"
  },
  {
   "type": "figure",
   "orig_src": "https://cdn.savemyexams.com/uploads/2020/01/The-digestion-of-starch.png",
